From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:32:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 46/52] Move system status output formats and download name to
 xapi_aux
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

The new System_status_helpers module holds the Output type, moved from
System_status, and make_filename, which builds the name under which a
host's system status report is downloaded from the host name and the
output format. System_status uses both for the local host; the CLI
server, which cannot depend on xapi, will be able to use them for any
host.

Signed-off-by: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
---
 ocaml/xapi-aux/dune                      |  2 +
 ocaml/xapi-aux/system_status_helpers.ml  | 49 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 ocaml/xapi-aux/system_status_helpers.mli | 29 ++++++++++++++
 ocaml/xapi/system_status.ml              | 40 +++----------------
 4 files changed, 85 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ocaml/xapi-aux/system_status_helpers.ml
